---
title: MF-04 · Client schedules an interview
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor CL as Client Company User
  participant FE as Web App
  participant API as Recruitment endpoints
  participant H as ScheduleInterview handler
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant HUB as SignalR hub
  actor CA as Candidate
  CL->>FE: Pick time, type, location / link
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/recruitment/applications/{id}/interviews
  API->>H: Send(ScheduleInterviewCommand)
  alt caller is Internal HR or not a company member
  API-->>FE: 403
  else allowed
  H->>DB: Interview SCHEDULED, Application INTERVIEW, AuditLog
  H->>HUB: Publish after commit
  HUB->>CA: Bell updates in real time, candidate confirms attendance
  API-->>FE: 201 Created
  end
